1795358812716	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-6266076333177100335"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-22T09:46:52.716-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-22T09:46:52.716-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-rb1"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-britannia"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"रोमन ब्रिटानियाको कथा, भाग १: दैत्यहरूको काम"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"ढुङ्गाका चक्र र नीलो रङ पोतेका योद्धाहरूको टापुले पहिलो पटक रोमन चीलको छाया कसरी महसुस गर्‍योयदि तपाईंले भाइकिङ्स (Vikings) टेलिभिजन शृङ्खला हेर्नुभएको छ भने, एउटा शान्त दृश्य सायद याद होला—जहाँ भिक्षु एथेल्स्टान र वेसेक्सका राजा एक्बर्ट पुराना रोमन भग्नावशेषको छायामुनि सँगै उभिएका हुन्छन्।ढुङ्गाका विशाल मेहराबहरूतिर हेर्दै एक्बर्ट सोध्छन्—कुनै मान्छेको हातले यति परिपूर्ण संरचना कसरी कुँद्न सक्यो "},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/6266076333177100335/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/roman-britannia-bhag-1-daityaharuko-kaam.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/6266076333177100335"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/6266076333177100335"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/roman-britannia-bhag-1-daityaharuko-kaam.html","title":"रोमन ब्रिटानियाको कथा, भाग १: दैत्यहरूको काम"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#th